- Task manager labels/statuses: not yet configured for this project — see
  the Harness's `claude/skills/task-manager-culture/SKILL.md` for the
  fill-in procedure once a tracker is chosen.
- Claude Code users additionally get a roster of specialist subagents
  (risk-analyst, pr-drafter, data-analyst, log-analyst, docs-writer,
  task-triage, debugger) via `~/.claude/agents/` — this is Claude-Code-
  specific packaging; the underlying procedures are plain markdown any
  tool can be pointed at directly if needed (see the Harness's `claude/`
  folder).
- Secrets-by-label convention: never a raw value in this repo. See the
  Harness's `Secrets/manifest.yaml` and `Scripts/harness/secure/`.

Project-specific rules above always take precedence over the general
principles when they conflict.
